116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (Shoelotskey faces operational inefficiencies due to the reliance on paper-based record-keeping and a lack of data-driven decision-making tools. The current manual system fails to provide accurate service completion estimates, leading to inconsistent customer experiences. Additionally, the lack of an analytical dashboard prevents the management from identifying growth trends or operational bottlenecks. Without a web-based system integrated with Machine Learning, the business remains reactive rather than proactive, limiting its ability to scale and maintain high service standards with community and nearby cities.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
